# NebulaForge

NebulaForge is a lightweight automation framework designed for developers who value clean architecture and modular design.

## Features

- Modular architecture
- Fast and lightweight
- Easy configuration
- Extensible plugin system
- Cross-platform support

## Installation

```bash
git clone https://github.com/yourusername/NebulaForge.git
cd NebulaForge
NebulaForge/
│── main.py
│── config.py
│── requirements.txt
│── README.md
└── core/
    ├── engine.py
    ├── utils.py
    └── plugins.py
